    "## Cell 2 — Substitution chain generation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Fibonacci:** A → AB, B → A (encoded 0, 1)  \n",
    "**Tribonacci (Rauzy):** 1 → 12, 2 → 13, 3 → 1 (encoded 0, 1, 2)\n",
    "\n",
    "Companion matrix $T_3 = \\bigl(\\begin{smallmatrix}1&1&1\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\end{smallmatrix}\\bigr)$, $\\det(T_3)=1$, $\\rho(T_3)=\\eta$.  \n",
    "Letter frequencies → PF eigenvector: $(f_1,f_2,f_3)\\approx(0.5437,0.2956,0.1607)$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cell-02",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cell 2 — Substitution chain generation\n",
    "\n",
    "def fibonacci_word(length):\n",
    "    \"\"\"A→AB, B→A. Returns first `length` symbols as list of ints.\"\"\"\n",
    "    word = [0]\n",
    "    rules = {0: [0, 1], 1: [0]}\n",
    "    while len(word) < length:\n",
    "        word = [s for c in word for s in rules[c]]\n",
    "    return word[:length]\n",
    "\n",
